**Fixed.** The About page had three bugs stacked on top of each other, all from earlier bad edits:

1. **Extra `)` on the testimonials map** (line 203) — `)))}` should have been `))}`, which is what caused the "Unterminated JSX contents" babel error.
2. **Hero `<section>` never closed** — the corporate banner and services sections were accidentally nested inside the hero section, making every closing tag mismatch at the end of the file.
3. **Stray extra `</div>`** at the very bottom of the return — one `</div>` too many after fixing #2.

For the horizontal scroll specifically: the page-level scroll was already contained by the `overflow-clip` wrapper, but I added `overflow-x: hidden` on `body` in [index.css](demo-store/src/index.css) as a guarantee — the floating hero images (`right-[5%]`, `left-[6%]` + parallax transforms) can push past the edge at certain viewport widths, and this locks it down everywhere.

**Verified:** `vite build` passes (459 modules, no errors), dev server restarted on `localhost:5173`, About page loads with zero console errors, zero horizontal scroll at 627px and 1440px viewports, all 5 sections and both marquees render correctly.
